From b770fa88bb16bd78c557692e3ae7778c7e7f0790 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 13:32:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 675/913] plat-stm32mp2: let PWR IRQ to propagate to parent GIC

Populate all the API in struct itr_ops to propagate the requests
to the parent interrupt controller (GIC).
The struct itr_ops will be used later.

While there:
- rename gic_hdl with the more generic parent_hdl;
- get parent interrupt controller from DT;
- replace interrupt_alloc_add_handler() with interrupt_create_handler();
- use mask/unmask in interrupt context instead of enable/disable.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 5e2956c2289f176e1d9afc07f8f24e6c120751d2 plat-stm32mp2: let PWR IRQ to propagate to parent GIC]
Signed-off-by: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I4b1534ab3c42dba4331f8a172ccacbef824739df
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/434935
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/drivers/stm32mp25_pwr.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/drivers/stm32mp25_pwr.c b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/drivers/stm32mp25_pwr.c
index 18f23ca4f..ee0a5113c 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/drivers/stm32mp25_pwr.c
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/drivers/stm32mp25_pwr.c
@@ -395,7 +395,7 @@ static TEE_Result stm32mp_pwr_probe(const void *fdt, int node,
 		panic("Failed to apply rif_config");
 
 #ifdef CFG_STM32_PWR_IRQ
-	res = stm32mp25_pwr_irq_probe(fdt, node, pwr_d->interrupt);
+	res = stm32mp25_pwr_irq_probe(fdt, node);
 	if (res) {
 		if (pwr_d->conf_data) {
 			free(pwr_d->conf_data->access_mask);
